{
  "$comment": "Price ratios used by scripts/session-impact.mjs to express token totals in input-token equivalents. Each ratio is a list price per token divided by the same model's base input price per token, computed from the table row kept in `quote`, as opened on `verifiedAt`. Ratios compare token kinds inside one model's price list: they are not money and they do not compare models whose base prices differ. Batch, fast and data residency modifiers are not modelled. A subscription is not billed per token; the ratios stand in for relative cost. Entries older than 90 days are re-checked against `source` before use. A ratio that could not be confirmed is left out, and the script then leaves the weighted fields out instead of guessing.",
  "unit": "input-token equivalents (1 = one uncached input token of the same model at its base price)",
  "verifiedAt": "2026-11-23",
